{
  "id": "ISA.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 3",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, behold, the Lord, Jehovah of hosts, doth take away from Jerusalem and from Judah stay and staff, the whole stay of bread, and the whole stay of water; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mighty man, and the man of war; the judge, and the prophet, and the diviner, and the elder; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the captain of fifty, and the honorable man, and the counsellor, and the expert artificer, and the skilful enchanter. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will give children to be their princes, and babes shall rule over them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people shall be oppressed, every one by another, and every one by his neighbor: the child shall behave himself proudly against the old man, and the base against the honorable. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When a man shall take hold of his brother in the house of his father, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Thou hast clothing, be thou our ruler, and let this ruin be under thy hand; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in that day shall he lift up ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying, I will not be a healer; for in my house is neither bread nor clothing: ye shall not make me ruler of the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Jerusalem is ruined, and Judah is fallen; because their tongue and their doings are against Jehovah, to provoke the eyes of his glory. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The show of their countenance doth witness against them; and they declare their sin as Sodom, they hide it not. Woe unto their soul! for they have done evil unto themselves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say ye of the righteous, that ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " well ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for they shall eat the fruit of their doings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe unto the wicked! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ill ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for what his hands have done shall be done unto him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for my people, children are their oppressors, and women rule over them. O my people, they that lead thee cause thee to err, and destroy the way of thy paths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovah standeth up to contend, and standeth to judge the peoples. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovah will enter into judgment with the elders of his people, and the princes thereof: It is ye that have eaten up the vineyard; the spoil of the poor is in your houses: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "what mean ye that ye crush my people, and grind the face of the poor? saith the Lord, Jehovah of hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover Jehovah said, Because the daughters of Zion are haughty, and walk with outstretched necks and wanton eyes, walking and mincing as they go, and making a tinkling with their feet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore the Lord will smite with a scab the crown of the head of the daughters of Zion, and Jehovah will lay bare their secret parts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day the Lord will take away the beauty of their anklets, and the cauls, and the crescents; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the pendants, and the bracelets, and the mufflers; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the headtires, and the ankle chains, and the sashes, and the perfume-boxes, and the amulets; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the rings, and the nose-jewels; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the festival robes, and the mantles, and the shawls, and the satchels; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the hand-mirrors, and the fine linen, and the turbans, and the veils. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, that instead of sweet spices there shall be rottenness; and instead of a girdle, a rope; and instead of well set hair, baldness; and instead of a robe, a girding of sackcloth; branding instead of beauty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy men shall fall by the sword, and thy mighty in the war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And her gates shall lament and mourn; and she shall be desolate and sit upon the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.4",
    "number": "4",
    "bookId": "ISA"
  },
